    "detailed_description": "Quash is an immersive arcade game in which you control a racket allowing you to destroy gigantic walls standing in front of you.<br />\r\nAchieving the highest score, beating time with the level, never losing the ball are challenges that you will encounter in game.<br />\r\nThe solo campaign offers a challenge adapted to all players and allows you to progress between each level.<br />\r\nA multiplayer gives you the opportunity to defeat your friends.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nA game for everyone: Anyone can pick up the controller and play the game. It\u2019s as simple as doing a racket sport<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSolo campaign: Get better at every level, every level is unique and challenges you on several skills<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMultiplayer: Defy your friends in 4 different maps<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBest music possible: made by the incredible Pierrick Querolle<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExercise: Quash is a great way to exercise while smashing bricks!",
